-Rowland1"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rowland</surname><given-names>LP</given-names></name><name><surname>Shneider</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis.</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><volume>344</volume><fpage>1688</fpage><lpage>1700</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11386269</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0032664-Baltrons2"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baltrons</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Pifarre</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferrer</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Carot</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Reduced expression of NO-sensitive guanylyl cyclase in reactive astrocytes of Alzheimer disease, Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease, and multiple sclerosis brains.</article-title><source>Neurobiol Dis</source><volume>17</volume><fpage>462</fpage><lpage>472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15571982</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0032664-Dupiereux1"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dupiereux</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Zorzi</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Quadrio</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Perret-Liaudet</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kovacs</surname><given-names>GG</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2009</year><article-title>Creutzfeldt-jakob, Parkinson, lewy body dementia and Alzheimer diseases: from diagnosis to therapy.</article-title><source>Cent N